<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $62-7/8 (FIM 295.70).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $62-7/8 (FIM 295.70).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR closed up $2-3/8 at $62-7/8 -- its highest since October 18, 1995 -- in New York on Thursday. It earlier hit an intrasession high of $63-1/4.</p>
<p>Nokia's Wall Street closing equals about 295.70 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki on Thursday, Nokia A closed up 2.00 markka at 292.50.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) ended up $0-1/8 at $35-3/8 on Wall Street on Thursday. The price equals about 83.18 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed down 0.50 markka at 82.00.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR fell $0-1/2 to $20 in New York on Thursday. The price equals about 94.06 markka. In Helsinki, Rauma closed down 2.00 markka at 94.00 markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 235</p>
